flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read name and 5 marks/]
    B --> C{All marks in 0..100?}
    C -- No --> D[Display invalid marks]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -- Yes --> E[Calculate total and percentage]
    E --> F{Any mark below 35?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Display Fail]
    F -- No --> H[Determine grade from percentage]
    G --> I[Display results]
    H --> I
    I --> Z
